OL,3,AChancellor to unveil growth plan with
OL,4,A#150m fund for northern firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey is set to unveil
OL,7,Fa #150m fund for companies in the north
OL,8,Fof England as part of a wider plan to
OL,9,Fgenerate more economic growth around
OL,10,Fthe UK.
OL,12,FIn a speech on Monday, he is expected
OL,13,Fto outline his proposal to boost
OL,14,Fdevelopment by using public investment
OL,15,Fto attract private capital.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
