OL,3,AChancellor to unveil growth plan with
OL,4,A#150m fund for northern firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe speech comes against a challenging
OL,7,Fbackdrop as the chancellor faces
OL,8,Fpressures ahead of his first Budget on
OL,9,F28 October, including concerns about a
OL,10,Fjump in government borrowing costs and
OL,11,Fthe inflationary impact of the Iran
OL,12,Fwar.
OL,14,FIn response to Healey's plan, the
OL,15,FConservatives said that what was being
OL,16,Fproposed would "do little to comfort
OL,17,Fhard-working families and businesses".
